        // With normal fees (multiplier = 100), the fee would be:
        // totalFee = 20+40+20+10 = 90
        // feeAmount = amount * 90 * 100 / (1000 * 100) = amount * 9000 / 100000 = amount * 0.09 = 9%
        // So for 100 tokens, 9 tokens would be taken as fee, attacker would have 91 less
        // But with multiplier = 0, feeAmount = amount * 90 * 0 / 100000 = 0
        // So attacker should have exactly (initialBalance - transferAmount)

